SET SIZE 8 8
READ MESH
FOR Y=0 1 2 3 4
 X=0 Z=0 0 0 0 0
 X=1 Z=0 1 2 1 0
 X=2 Z=0 2 3 2 0
 X=3 Z=0 1 2 1 0
 X=4 Z=0 0 0 0 0

SET WINDOW X 1 OF 2
SET WINDOW Y 2 OF 2
HISTOGRAM HIDE XY DX=0.5 DY=0.5 BLUE
PLOT AXIS HIDE

SET WINDOW X 1 OF 2
SET WINDOW Y 1 OF 2
CONTOUR FROM 0 TO 3 BY 1

SET THREE OFF
SET WINDOW X 2 OF 2
SET WINDOW Y 1 OF 2
PLOT RANDOM=10
